OL,3,GNEWSAManx Care overspend forecast more
OL,4,Athan doubles
OL,5,
OL,6,FManx Care now expects to end the
OL,7,Ffinancial year #19.2m over budget, more
OL,8,Fthan double the overspend it forecast
OL,9,Fin May.
OL,11,FThe health and care provider had
OL,12,Fpredicted it would go #8.1m over its
OL,13,F#404.2m budget for 2026-27.
OL,15,FBoard papers point to emergency care,
OL,16,Ftemporary staff and higher than
OL,17,Fexpected pay rises as the main reasons.
OL,19,FInterim chief executive Dr Chris
OL,20,FStockport said the forecast was "not
OL,21,Fwhere we want or expect to finish the
OL,22,Fyear".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
